flowchart LR
    Operator[Shop operator] --> Desktop
    subgraph Frontend["Desktop frontend: Electron + React + Vite"]
        Desktop[Electron BrowserWindow]
        State[React state<br/>token and form data]
        Main[Electron main process<br/>safeStorage, IPC, print driver]
        Preload[Context-isolated preload]
        Desktop <--> State
        Desktop --> Preload --> Main
    end
    Desktop -->|HTTPS JSON in production<br/>HTTP localhost in development| Server
    subgraph Backend["Backend: Node.js + Express"]
        Server[Express routes]
        Middleware[Short-lived JWT and active-device checks]
        DeviceAuth[Challenge-response login]
        Pool[PostgreSQL connection pool]
        Server --> Middleware
        Middleware --> Pool
        Server --> Pool
        Server --> DeviceAuth --> Pool
    end
    Pool -->|SQL queries and transactions| PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL database)]
    PostgreSQL --- Tables[authorised_devices<br/>device_auth_challenges<br/>daily_gold_rates<br/>customers<br/>debt_payments]
